\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Per-model paired tests on the procedural-$\Delta $, under both judging paths. Both models have a positive $\Delta $ with bootstrap CI excluding zero in both paths. Under LLM-only re-judge, v2.0's $p{=}0.00098$ comfortably survives Bonferroni correction across the two tests (the deterministic-mixed $p{=}0.049$ would not). Neither test is replicated across seeds.}}{10}{table.caption.9}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:stats-per-model}{{5}{10}{Per-model paired tests on the procedural-$\Delta $, under both judging paths. Both models have a positive $\Delta $ with bootstrap CI excluding zero in both paths. Under LLM-only re-judge, v2.0's $p{=}0.00098$ comfortably survives Bonferroni correction across the two tests (the deterministic-mixed $p{=}0.049$ would not). Neither test is replicated across seeds}{table.caption.9}{}}
